### Publisher

```typescript
class Publisher<T> {
    publish(message: T): Promise<void>;
    getTopic(): string;
}
```

### Subscriber

```typescript
class Subscriber<T> {
    onMessage(callback: (message: T) => void): void;
    getTopic(): string;
}
```

